        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "是 can characterize what something is like. 有 can say that a measurement reaches an amount; the amount is not a possessed object.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他是个好人。",
                "pinyin": "tā shì gè hǎorén 。",
                "meaning": "He is a good person.",
                "audio": "dbabad32779e408ff3be80d1bb5cf15fc8a78f1f720b6575c3aaa7dc97caf92f"
              },
              {
                "text": "这条路有三千米长。",
                "pinyin": "zhè tiáo lù yǒu sān qiān mǐ cháng 。",
                "meaning": "This road is three kilometers long.",
